wrong: Go one iteration at a time. n = 1, 2, 3 → total 6. n = 4 → continue, total stays 6. n = 5, 6, 7 → total 24. n = 8 → skipped. n = 9 → 33. n = 10 → `10 > 9`, break: n ends at 10.

